# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# NOTE: www -> apex host redirect is handled via a Cloudflare Redirect Rule
# in the dashboard instead of here — Workers Static Assets only allows
# relative URLs in _redirects, not absolute cross-host URLs.

# ── Index-page canonicalization ─────────────────────────────────────
# Without this, "/" and "/index.html" (and a hypothetical "/index.php")
# serve identical content as two separate 200 URLs — flagged as a
# duplicate/"accessible index page" issue by SEO auditors.
/index.html  /  301
/index.php   /  301
